# Bonus Problem 12 – Print Unique Elements

### Code

```python
a = (10,20,10,30,40,20,50)

for i in a:
    if a.count(i) == 1:
        print(i)
```

### Output

```
30
40
50
```

### Logic

Print elements whose frequency is exactly one.

